{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43934","headline":"拾得韦氏花钿以诗寄赠 · 张夫人","name":"拾得韦氏花钿以诗寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝妆阁前，拾得旧花钿。\n粉汚痕犹在，尘侵色尚鲜。\n曾经纤手里，拈向翠眉边。\n能助千金笑，如何忍弃捐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张夫人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}